  "description": "Ryan Estate Agents is pleased to present this Two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment to the rental market, ideally positioned at 59 Belmont, Middle Gardiner Street, Dublin 1.\n\nThe property enjoys a convenient city-centre location within a short walk of the IFSC, Mater Hospital, Temple Street Children’s Hospital and O’Connell Street. A wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and other everyday amenities is available nearby.\n\nThe area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous Dublin Bus routes, Connolly Station, Busáras and the Luas Red Line all within walking distance, providing convenient access throughout Dublin and beyond.\n\nPlease submit all enquiries by email only.",
